Everything else

The MIT License at the top of this file governs the rest of this
repository -- all original toy-os source code, documentation and
tooling.

tools/check_licenses.py checks that this inventory stays true: every
vendored port and every shipped font must carry a license file and be
named above. A list kept accurate by somebody remembering is the shape
of every maintenance burden this project has deleted.
